{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>ולנפיל.</b> The lamed is opened with a pataḥ to indicate the missing construction he, and likewise לשמיד." "<b>אמן.</b> Sometimes [with] dagesh."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {0 "The Hebrew says נפתח הלמ\"ד 'the lamed is opened'; the vowel in question is the pataḥ under the lamed in וְלְנַפִּל, indicating a lost heh of the hif'il binyan."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:27.937280981Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}